Sire’s Hollow Joint Preservation Society

[en.C09_despotic_party]
Equestria Unity Commission

[en.C09_DESC]
After Stella Flare and Firelight reconciled, the leadership of Sire’s Hollow alternates between the Development Committee and the Preservation Society regularly. The residents of Sire’s Hollow enjoy a peaceful life that intertwines modernity and tradition.
During Firelight’s term, Sire’s Hollow survived the Ultimate Battle and the subsequent turmoil by hiding behind tradition and conservatism. Now, Stella Flare is about to take over Firelight’s position, and her term will be a period of development and openness for Sire’s Hollow. Under Stella Flare’s leadership, the goal of Sire’s Hollow is to become a new economic center in all of Equestria.

[en.PIHC_WS_C09_desc]
Sire’s Hollow is a lucky town. After Stella Flare and Firelight reconciled, the leadership of Sire’s Hollow alternates between the Development Committee and the Preservation Society regularly. The residents of Sire’s Hollow enjoy a peaceful life that intertwines modernity and tradition.
Sire’s Hollow is located on the border of the western Equestria, north of Tartarus Prison. The Equestria Empire does not care much about this place, and it is close to the Changeling Empire, naturally becoming a buffer zone between the Equestria Empire and the Changeling Empire. Sire’s Hollow has thus gained a special status, and its residents enjoy the dual protection of the Equestria Empire and the Changeling Empire.
That’s not all, Firelight is the father of Starlight Glimmer, which also means that the resistance will not seek to bother Sire’s Hollow; the Development Committee led by Stella Flare receives many visitors from Cloudsdale, Crystal Empire, and other places every year, meaning that third-party countries have no reason to attack Sire’s Hollow either.
However, the Sire’s Hollow Joint Council will not be satisfied with being the pet of the two empires. During Firelight’s term, Sire’s Hollow survived the Ultimate Battle and the subsequent turmoil by hiding behind tradition and conservatism. Now, Stella Flare is about to take over Firelight’s position, and her term will be a period of development and openness for Sire’s Hollow. Under Stella Flare’s leadership, the goal of Sire’s Hollow is to become a new economic center in all of Equestria.
Desire is the source of danger, and Stella Flare’s grand vision for Sire’s Hollow has made Sire’s Hollow make enemies for the first time — the current economic center of Equestria, the Las Pegasus Economic Zone. Stella Flare hopes to cooperate with the empire to replace the Las Pegasus Economic Zone; while Firelight is more inclined to cooperate with the Changeling Empire to help the Las Pegasus Economic Zone to become independent from the control of the Equestria Empire...

[zh.C09]
名流谷联合会

[zh.C09_DEF]
名流谷联合会

[zh.C09_ADJ]
联合会

[zh.C09_democratic_party]
名流谷联合会

[zh.C09_democratic_oligarchy_party]
名流谷联合发展委员会

[zh.C09_democratic_democracy_party]
名流谷联合保护协会

[zh.C09_despotic_party]
小马利亚团结委员会

[zh.C09_DESC]
自从恒星耀斑和火光和解后，在名流谷联合会的框架下，由发展委员会和保护协会规律地交替领导着，名流谷的居民们在这里享受着现代与传统交织的平静生活。
在火光的任期内，凭借着传统和保守的主张，名流谷龟缩着躲过了终末之战和随后的诸多动乱。如今，恒星耀斑将要接过火光的职位，她的任期将会是名流谷的发展和开放时期。在联合发展委员会恒星耀斑的领导下，名流谷的目标是走向全小马利亚，成为新兴的经济中心。

[zh.PIHC_WS_C09_desc]
名流谷是一个幸运的小镇。自从恒星耀斑和火光和解后，在名流谷联合会的框架下，由发展委员会和保护协会规律地交替领导着，名流谷的居民们在这里享受着现代与传统交织的平静生活。
名流谷位于西小马国的边陲沿海，塔尔塔洛斯监狱北侧。小马利亚帝国对这里并不怎么上心，而这里又靠近幻形灵帝国，自然而然地成为了小马与幻形灵的缓冲区。名流谷因此获得了一种特殊的地位，这里的居民们享有着小马利亚帝国和幻形灵帝国的双重保护。
这还没完，火光是星光熠熠的父亲，这也意味着抵抗组织也不会找上名流谷的事；恒星耀斑领导的发展委员会每年接待不少来自云中城、水晶帝国等地的游客，意味着第三方国家也没有理由对名流谷动手。
但名流谷联合会并不会满足于成为两大帝国精巧的宠物，在火光的任期内，凭借着传统和保守的主张，名流谷龟缩着躲过了终末之战和随后的诸多动乱。如今，恒星耀斑将要接过火光的职位，她的任期将会是名流谷的发展和开放时期。在联合发展委员会恒星耀斑的领导下，名流谷的目标是走向全小马利亚，成为新兴的经济中心。
欲望是危险的源头，恒星耀斑对名流谷的远大目标，使得名流谷第一次树敌——当前的小马利亚经济中心，洛马基经济特区。恒星耀斑期望与帝国合作，取代洛马基经济特区的地位；而火光则更倾向于与幻形灵帝国合作，帮助洛马基经济特区，一起从小马利亚帝国的控制下独立出来...

